# Expo SDK 57 has a known bug (expo/expo#50153) where Metro's lazy dev-mode
# bundling never builds the chunk for expo-sqlite's web worker, causing
# every web route to 500 with "Worker chunk not found for: .../worker.ts".
# Forcing eager bundling avoids the broken code path. Fixed upstream in SDK 58
# (expo/expo#50244); remove this once the project upgrades past SDK 57.
EXPO_NO_METRO_LAZY=1
